WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.288 --> 00:00:02.705
(soft music)

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.550
- [Narrator] Easter Island is known

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.561
for its stone heads, but
recently its coastal shores

00:00:45.561 --> 00:00:48.793
have been increasingly
covered by plastic waste.

00:00:49.881 --> 00:00:50.714
(soft music)

00:00:50.714 --> 00:00:52.870
After meeting his future wife
while visiting the island

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.240
in 1989, Francis Picco
decided to do something

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.310
about this mounting problem.

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:01.360
He has dedicated his life
to restoring the coastline

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.963
to its former beauty.

00:01:02.963 --> 00:01:05.380
(soft music)

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.190
With only some plastic
bags and determination,

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.910
Francis explored the shores
and started cleaning,

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:38.830
and over the past 20 years,
he has removed an estimated

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.899
100 tons of plastic garbage.

00:01:41.899 --> 00:01:44.399
(soft music)

00:02:19.452 --> 00:02:22.535
(instrumental music)

